ors to solve the case!","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheBakerStreetBachelors","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2009-03-04T13:22:55Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheBakerStreetBachelors/BakerStreetBachelors_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheDiamondTooth","number":2,"title_en":"The Case of the Diamond Tooth","description_en":"Season 1, Ep 38: The Case of the Diamond Tooth\nHolmes is on the case of a man who is found dead in the river.","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheDiamondTooth","runtime_min":26,"added_at":"2009-03-06T16:30:54Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheDiamondTooth/DiamondTooth_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheHauntedGainsborough","number":3,"title_en":"The Case of the Haunted Gainsborough","description_en":"Season 1, Ep 35: The Case of the Haunted Gainsborough\nThis is the story of the hunt for the MacGregan treasure -- and curse!","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheHauntedGainsborough","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2009-03-04T14:19:31Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheHauntedGainsborough/HauntedGainsborough_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheNeuroticDetective","number":4,"title_en":"The Case of the Neurotic Detective","description_en":"Season 1, Ep 36: The Case of the Neurotic Detective\nHolmes begins acting even stranger than usual -- he tries to keep Watson from seeing the diamond necklace in his humidor, refuses to help Lestrade with the crime wave and dresses up to go to a dance!","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheNeuroticDetective","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2009-03-04T15:06:58Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheNeuroticDetective/NeuroticDetective_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheTyrantsDaughter","number":5,"title_en":"The Case of the Tyrant's Daughter","description_en":"Season 1, Ep 39: The Case of the Tyrant's Daughter","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheTyrantsDaughter","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2009-03-06T16:54:33Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheTyrantsDaughter/TyrantsDaughter_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheUnluckyGambler","number":6,"title_en":"The Case of the Unlucky Gambler","description_en":"Season 1, Ep 37: The Case of the Unlucky Gambler\nAndrew Fenwick hires Holmes to find his missing father, Herbert Fenwick. The trail leads to some pubhopping!","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheUnluckyGambler","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2009-03-06T13:33:38Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseOfTheUnluckyGambler/UnluckyGambler_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofLadyBeryl","number":7,"title_en":"The Case of Lady Beryl","description_en":"The New Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\n\"The Case of Lady Beryl\"\nOriginally aired October 25, 1954.\nLady Beryl admits to a crime she did not commit. Holmes not only reveals the true murderer, but Lady Beryl's motive for lying about the crime.","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofLadyBeryl","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2007-07-31T09:30:41Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofLadyBeryl/TheCaseofLadyBeryl.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofLadyBeryl/TheCaseofLadyBeryl_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":1,"label":"Archive.org (low bitrate)","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost","number":8,"title_en":"The Case of the Belligerent Ghost","description_en":"The New Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\n\"The Case of the Belligerent Ghost\"\nOriginally aired November 15, 1954.\nWatson is quite flustered after a man in distress dies in his care...only to find himself attacked by the very same dead man on Watson's way back home to Baker Street! So what does this have to do with daVinci's \"Madonna on the Rocks\" painting allegedly being stolen?","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2007-08-03T06:02:29Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost/TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost/TheCaseoftheBelligerentGhost_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":1,"label":"Archive.org (low bitrate)","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage","number":9,"title_en":"The Case of the Cunningham Heritage","description_en":"The New Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\n\"The Case of the Cunningham Heritage\"\nOriginally aired October 18, 1954.\nHolmes unravels the mystery surrounding the death of Mr. Cunningham, a gentleman whose fiancée was found by his body with a knife in her hand.\nThis television episode marks the first filmed meeting between Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson. Based on \"A Study in Scarlet\" and very loosely \"The Adventure of the Reigate Squires/Puzzle.\"","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2007-07-31T06:35:40Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage/TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage/TheCaseoftheCunninghamHeritage_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":1,"label":"Archive.org (low bitrate)","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun","number":10,"title_en":"The Case of the Pennsylvania Gun","description_en":"The New Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\n\"The Case of the Pennsylvania Gun\"\nOriginally aired November 1, 1954.\nBased on the novel \"The Valley of Fear,\" Holmes and Watson are called to Sussex to investigate the murder of Squire John Douglas. The local inspector thinks he has it all figured out, but Holmes discovers the crime is more complicated than it looks.","still":"https://archive.org/services/img/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun","runtime_min":27,"added_at":"2007-08-01T15:01:11Z","streams":[{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun/TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":0,"label":"Archive.org","video_codec":"h264"},{"url":"https://archive.org/download/SherlockHolmes-TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun/TheCaseofthePennsylvaniaGun_512kb.mp4","type":"mp4","quality":"240p","priority":1,"label":"Archive.org (low bitrate)","video_codec":"h264"}]},{"id":"SherlockHolmes-TheCaseoftheShyBallerina","number":11,"title_en":"The Case of the Shy Ballerina","description_en":"The New Adventures of Sherlock Holmes\n\"The Case of the Shy Ballerina\"\nOriginally aired November 22, 1954.\nA simple case of mistakenly switched coats suddenly turns into blackmail and then murder! When poor Watson's hat was 